.\"
.\" ===== STANDARDS =====
.\"
.SH STANDARDS
.B xf
is written in POSIX C99 (ISO/IEC 9899:1999 with POSIX.1-2008 extensions) and
should work on any POSIX-compatible system including Linux, macOS, and BSD
variants.
.PP
Regular expressions follow the POSIX Extended Regular Expression (ERE) standard
as documented in
.BR regex (7).
.\"
